Error: Jet.ValueNotSendable: This task returns `fn(Int) -[]> Int Never!`, which isn't sendable
  --> Tests/UI/task_spawn_parameters.jet:2:15
    |
  2 |     t: task { fn(x: Int) { x } }
    |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The closure holds state that cannot cross this boundary; tasks and channels move owned values between threads
 Fix: Give the task plain owned data, or rebuild the value as an owned copy before spawning
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.ValueNotSendable

Error: Jet.FallbackTypeMismatch: The fallback is Int (a whole number), but the success value is fn(Int) -[]> Int Never!
  --> Tests/UI/task_spawn_parameters.jet:3:23
    |
  3 |     print(t.join() ?? 0)
    |                       ^
 Why: Both sides of `??` must be the same type
 Fix: Use fn(Int) -[]> Int Never! here
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.FallbackTypeMismatch

Error: Jet.ValueTypeMismatch: `print` doesn't know how to show fn(Int) -[]> Int Never!
  --> Tests/UI/task_spawn_parameters.jet:3:11
    |
  3 |     print(t.join() ?? 0)
    |           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Print shows values that have a display
 Fix: Print one of its parts instead
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.ValueTypeMismatch
